&lt;h3 id="finger-exercise-2-count-occurrences-of-an-character-in-a-string"&gt;Finger Exercise 2: Count occurrences of an character in a String&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write a method that takes a String s and a character c as parameters and returns
